    array.push(cC, "CONFIRMED (strengthened)~No new Fed remark verified today; December 25bp 96%. Shadow R3 +2, raw 6.3 → +6. FOMC minutes 21:00 Bucharest.|CONFIRMED~No verified Senate PLFSS result and no OAT–Bund reading after 155.0bp (16 Nov).|WEAKENED (watch)~UK CPI 3.6% (in line, BoE saw 3.7%), services 3.7% vs 3.8%; Dec hike odds 74%. Bearish condition half met; +1 held.|CONFIRMED (watch)~No verified MoF/BoJ comment today; raw −0.9 held at 0. Japan CPI Fri 01:30 Bucharest.|INVALIDATED (bullish condition met, mode~Tuesday's VIX close 25.46 still meets the 'VIX above 25' condition; regime re-measured only from Friday closes.|CONFIRMED (bearish reinforced)~Brent $92, near its lowest since 31 Aug; no Canadian release. Raw −4.5 held at −4.|WEAKENED (watch)~No new item after the Q3 wage beat (raw 3.6, held +3); October jobs Thu 02:30 Bucharest.|CONFIRMED~No NZ data, RBNZ or election item today.|CONFIRMED · fragile (gap −3)~G −3 unchanged; XAU shadow = G + USD shadow = +3. Gold below $3,800 is price context only.")
